<title>USA: Microware names Kent Kelderman CFO.</title>
<headline>Microware names Kent Kelderman CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microware Systems Corp said interim chief financial officer Kent Kelderman was named chief financial officer effective December 23.</p>
<p>Kelderman previously was Microware corporate controller.</p>
<p>As CFO, he replaces George Barry, who resigned to puruse other interests, said the software company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
